{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Staying Asleep", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > Dreams: What Do Yours Mean?", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sleep schedule", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a regular pattern of sleeping and waking", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I try to stick to a sleep schedule. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about sleeping habits.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "light sleeper", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who wakes easily", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am a light sleeper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slight", "type": "name"}, {"content": "small; tiny", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  The slightest bit of noise wakes me up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bedtime routine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the things you do before you go to bed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to change my bedtime routine. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to unwind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to relax and stop feeling anxious", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to find an activity that helps me unwind before I go to bed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to meditate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend time sitting in a silent state, in order to relax completely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I try meditating for at least 10 minutes every evening. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "soothing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a gentle calming feeling", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You ought to listen to some soothing music.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "appealing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "attractive or interesting", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The bath sounds like the most appealing choice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "essential oil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an oil from a plant that has a strong smell ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to include essential oils in my bath. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Present and Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When using the Present Continuous tense, we concentrate on the duration of a particular activity. You are aware of the passing of time between the start and the end of the activity. This activity is not permanent.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Examples: <ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'm having a hard time staying asleep!</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I have to find a new bedtime routine!</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Simple Present describes an action that is seen as complete.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I have a sleep schedule. </span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can offer advice and solutions to people on how to improve their health.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She said that I ought to visit the best doctor in the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'd better find the smallest one you can.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You might want to remove the largest distraction from your bedroom.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals could, should or might to give a solution.</br>  When offering advice and solutions, you can also use superlatives. You use a superlative adjective to talk about one thing in a group of things. Remember to always use <span class=\"strong\">the</span> with the superlative.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:  <ul><li>I advise ...</li> <li> You should/could ...</li> <li>You might ...</li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li> <li>You had better ... (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (10 - 12 lines) between you and a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your friend wants some advice and a possible solution for their problem. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your friend needs a bedtime routine. They want something that will help them relax but not something where they have to sit for a long time. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What's your solution?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading your dialogue aloud with a partner. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I offer a solution about a healthy habit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what my friend  is doing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read aloud with my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le08ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Dear Diary, </br><br/>\nSally says that I ought to stick to a sleep schedule but I'm a light sleeper. The slightest bit of noise usually wakes me up so I'm having a hard time staying asleep. I'm trying to read before I go to bed but I'm not liking it too much. My mom says I should stick with it, she finds it to be the most relaxing of activities. I'm thinking about another bedtime routine I can follow."}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "27000", "id": 2, "text": "I want to find one that helps me relax and unwind for the night. I read an article that advised meditating for about 10 minutes. It's the quickest way to relax your mind and body. The article also says I could listen to soothing music or soak in a warm bath. The warm bath sounds the most appealing."}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "47500", "id": 3, "text": "Sally mentioned that I might want to include some essential oils in my bath. She says it's one of the most calming things to do before bed, but it should be taken 60 to 90 minutes before bedtime."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1